{"t":"Furious Crater","s":"furious-crater-c1f1c","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Cloak_of_Terror_83ded3.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Furious Crater</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Cloak of Terror\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cloak_of_Terror_83ded3.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Kilmaresh\">Kilmaresh</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">South of <a href=\"#/wiki/Kilmaresh\">Kilmaresh</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33860,31833,3\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33860, 31833, 3)</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocation\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation(s)</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">All</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Level &amp; Skills' Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvlknights\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"> <div class=\"skills-box\"> <h3 class=\"skills-box-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-General\">General</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Knights</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">600?</span> and 120? / 100? (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">600?</span> and 125? /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">600?</span> and 110? /  (ML/Def)</div> </div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Profit Hourly</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\">Experience</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\">Loot</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: green\"><b>Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: green\"><b>Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">12.40.9997<br/>July 13, 2020<br/>Summer Update 2020</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThe Furious Crater is a hollow rock that lies south of <a href=\"#/wiki/Kilmaresh\">Kilmaresh</a> and east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Oramond\">Oramond</a>. It cannot be reached by land, but only through a magical teleport located in the <a href=\"#/quest/soul-war-quest\">Soul War Quest</a> hub. It has 5 floors, of which 3 are the main hunting grounds. The 4th floor (from to to bottom, as you go deeper into the crater) has a lever that leads to the ground floor, where <a href=\"#/wiki/Goshnar%27s%20Cruelty\">Goshnar's Cruelty</a> can be found. In order to travel between the floors, players must use regular and Fog portals. Access to the lower floors is obtained by collecting charges left by the creatures on the previous floor, and this access must be repeated every time the player enters the hunting ground. \n</p><p>It is also possible to reach the ground floor by levitating <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33841,31867,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33841, 31867, 6)</a>. On this floor there are also creatures, as well as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Chest\">Chest</a> on the western corridor, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33810,31868,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33810, 31868, 7)</a>. By opening this chest you can get different items:\n</p>\n<ul><li>3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Ingot\">Gold Ingots</a></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Gem\">White Gem</a></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Diabolic%20Skull\">Diabolic Skull</a></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Unicorn%20Figurine\">Unicorn Figurine</a></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Gold\">Bar of Gold</a></li>\n<li>and possibly more.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cloak%20of%20Terror\"><img alt=\"Cloak of Terror\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cloak_of_Terror_83ded3.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Cloak%20of%20Terror\">Cloak of Terror</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">19,700</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">28,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">6150 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">650 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">3100 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Energy Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_9e8d1e.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">2400 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Holy Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Holy_Damage_Icon_dc372b.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Coin\">Crystal Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-6× <a href=\"#/wiki/Ultimate%20Health%20Potion\">Ultimate Health Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Ingot\">Gold Ingot</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Telescope Eye (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Wand of Starstorm (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Violet%20Gem\">Violet Gem</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Lightning Headband (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Gem\">Green Gem</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Gem\">Blue Gem</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Inferno\">Wand of Inferno</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Voodoo\">Wand of Voodoo</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Defiance\">Wand of Defiance</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Crown (Plant) (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Brooch o